  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic and Leadership Opportunities for Grassroots Women&apos;s Associations in Ahuachapn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMU will work with women in three grassroots associations in the department of Ahuachapn to improve their income, their food supply, and their leadership and organizational skills. With IMU&apos;s support, these farmers will raise livestock, cultivate organic vegetables, learn to produce and apply organic fertilizer and pesticide, and acquire better access to markets.</narrative>
  </description>
